==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*3 [[Duche]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Begin the battle by summoning [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] to chip Master A.'s health. Once Duche appears, spawn a heavy damage dealer such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris/Cyborg]]. Your rushers should keep damaging Master A. if he's alone. Keep repeating and you should eventually win.

